# 7. Project Documentation Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## Project Overview

FitBuddy is a web-based AI application that generates personalized 7-day fitness plans based on user details and fitness goals.

## Technologies Used

* Python
* FastAPI
* Google Gemini AI
* HTML, CSS and Jinja2
* SQLite
* SQLAlchemy
* Uvicorn
* Git

## Main Features

* Personalized workout plan generation
* Nutrition and recovery tips
* Feedback-based plan updates
* User and plan storage
* Admin/coach view

## Application Workflow

User enters details  
↓  
FastAPI processes the request  
↓  
Gemini AI generates the fitness plan  
↓  
Plan and nutrition tips are displayed  
↓  
User feedback can update the plan  
↓  
Data is stored in the database

## Project Pages

* `index.html` – User input
* `result.html` – Workout plan and feedback
* `all_users.html` – User and plan view

## Conclusion

FitBuddy provides an AI-powered approach to generating personalized fitness plans using Google Gemini models.
